cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "EvidPort: traceable evidence for AI agents"
abstract: >-
  A local evidence layer for AI agents that connects paper acquisition,
  versioned extraction, original-page provenance and quotation-specific
  review. Missing full text stays visible as a download task; bibliographic
  metadata never becomes a fabricated quotation. An optional local MCP server
  exposes the same workflow, preserving the source checks and the human-review
  gate.
authors:
